  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Fuel_Spin?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\nThe <b>fuel spin</b> is the place where players can get fuel for their <a href=\"/wiki/valley-31465\" title=\"Valley\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">valley</a> <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trucks</a>. It can be accessed by tapping the bottom-right fuel button. It has two tabs: one where players spin the fuel wheel, and one where players can see which activities they can do to get more fuel spins.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Getting fuel</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players can get Jerricans of fuel for free by spinning the valley wheel once every 24 hours (two times if you have Free Valley Fuel Spin Perk from <a href=\"/wiki/farm-pass-34637\" title=\"Farm Pass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Farm Pass</a>). The wheel lets you win between 6&#160;and 9 Jerricans with an average chance.\n</p><p>After that, players can pay 5 diamonds to spin the valley wheel one more time, or collect sun points from sun activities to spin the wheel for free additionally.\n</p><p>You can have up to 99 Jerricans of fuel.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Sun activities</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/61/Sun.png/revision/latest?cb=20190625060003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Sun\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sun\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/61/Sun.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20190625060003\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Sun</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Players can also get extra spins for the wheel by completing sun activities. Each players get three activities per day they can fulfill on their <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> multiple times. The activities available on current day and the next day can be seen in the sun tab inside fuel spin or in <a href=\"/wiki/levels-28802\" title=\"Levels\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">levels</a>.\n</p><p>Sun activities can be:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Planting <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a></li>\n<li>Feeding farm <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a></li>\n<li>Filling <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> crates or <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders</li>\n<li>Catching <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a> and placing nets and traps</li>\n<li>Doing <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derby</a> tasks</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<p><br>\nSee detailed table below.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Spin cost</b></span></h3>\n<p>Each activity gives the player between 1 and 20 suns. When a player has collected a certain number of suns, they can spin the wheel another time. The number of suns players need increase as they spin the wheel. The numbers are designated for Sanctuary Animals season.\n</p>\n<ul><li>2nd spin: 20 suns</li>\n<li>3rd spin: 50 suns</li>\n<li>4th spin: 100 suns</li>\n<li>5th spin: 200 suns</li>\n<li>6th spin: 550 suns</li>\n<li>7th spin: 1,000 suns</li>\n<li>8th spin: 1,500 suns</li>\n<li>9th spin: 2,100 suns</li>\n<li>10th spin: 2,800 suns</li>\n<li>11th spin: 3,600 suns</li>\n<li>12th spin: 4,500 suns</li>\n<li>13th spin: 6,000 suns</li>\n<li>14th spin: 8,000 suns</li>\n<li>15th spin: 10,000 suns</li>\n<li>16th spin: 15,000 suns</li></ul>\n<p>Since October 2024, the number of suns players need increase as they spin the wheel was reduced by 25%. The numbers are designated for Chicken Valley season.\n</p>\n<ul><li>2nd spin: 15 suns</li>\n<li>3rd spin: 35 suns</li>\n<li>4th spin: 75 suns</li>\n<li>5th spin: 150 suns</li>\n<li>6th spin: 410 suns</li>\n<li>7th spin: 750 suns</li>\n<li>8th spin: 1,125 suns</li>\n<li>9th spin: 1,575 suns</li>\n<li>10th spin: 2,100 suns</li>\n<li>11th spin: 2,700 suns</li>\n<li>12th spin: 3,375 suns</li>\n<li>13th spin: 4,500 suns</li>\n<li>14th spin: 6,000 suns</li>\n<li>15th spin: 7,500 suns</li>\n<li>16th spin: 11,250 suns</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Table of sun activities</b></span></h3>\n<p>In Chicken Valley season, sun points are double.\n</p>\n<table class=\"sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>No. of times\n</th>\n<th>Suns\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crops</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">carrots</a></td>\n<td>x10</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/61/Sun.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20190625060003\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/chili-pepper-2235\" title=\"Chili Pepper\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chili peppers</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/61/Sun.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20190625060003\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/chili-pepper-2235\" title=\"Chili Pepper\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chili peppers</a></td>\n<td>x2</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/corn-2063\" title=\"Corn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">corn</a></td>\n<td>x15</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/cotton-14254\" title=\"Cotton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cotton</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/cotton-14254\" title=\"Cotton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cotton</a>\n</td>\n<td>x4\n</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/indigo-2083\" title=\"Indigo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">indigo</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/indigo-2083\" title=\"Indigo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">indigo</a></td>\n<td>x4</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/lettuce-8898\" title=\"Lettuce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lettuce</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/potato-2693\" title=\"Potato\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">potatoes</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-2082\" title=\"Pumpkin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkin</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-2082\" title=\"Pumpkin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkins</a></td>\n<td>x4</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">soybeans</a></td>\n<td>x5</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/strawberry-2240\" title=\"Strawberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">strawberries</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/strawberry-2240\" title=\"Strawberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">strawberries</a></td>\n<td>x2</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/sugarcane-2080\" title=\"Sugarcane\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sugarcane</a></td>\n<td>x3</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plant <a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wheat</a></td>\n<td>x25</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Derby</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Complete a derby task worth over 235 points</td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>20<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Farm <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed any farm animal</td>\n<td>x5</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed any farm animal</td>\n<td>x10</td>\n<td>3<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chickens</a></td>\n<td>x5</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cows</a></td>\n<td>x2</td>\n<td>1<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cows</a></td>\n<td>x5</td>\n<td>3<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/pig-2491\" title=\"Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pigs</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/goat-2346\" title=\"Goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goats</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/goat-2346\" title=\"Goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goats</a>\n</td>\n<td>x2\n</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-2350\" title=\"Sheep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sheep</a>\n</td>\n<td>x1\n</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feed <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-2350\" title=\"Sheep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sheep</a>\n</td>\n<td>x2\n</td>\n<td>5<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Fishing activities\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catch <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catch <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a></td>\n<td>x4</td>\n<td>10<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Place <a href=\"/wiki/duck-trap-17075\" title=\"Duck Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duck traps</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-trap-17084\" title=\"Lobster Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster traps</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>10<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cast <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-net-16888\" title=\"Fishing Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing nets</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-net-16940\" title=\"Mystery Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery nets</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>15<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Produce fish <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lure</a></td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>8<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Orders\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fill <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> crates</td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fill <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> crates</td>\n<td>x4</td>\n<td>10<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fill <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders</td>\n<td>x1</td>\n<td>2<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fill <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders</td>\n<td>x4</td>\n<td>10<span>Sun</span><span title=\"Sun(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Sun\"><img alt=\"Sun\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>You cannot store more than 99 fuel, so use them and have a maximum of 90 fuel before you spin again! Or else, excess fuel is discarded (94 + 6 = 99, 1 fuel discarded)</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831234014\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 480/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12016/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 42/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1028089/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.650      1 -total\n 83.65%   31.494     37 Template:Infoicon\n  4.53%    1.706      1 Template:Languages\n  3.13%    1.178      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  2.65%    0.998      1 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:31467-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831234014 and revision id 110958. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
